<title>SPAIN: City of Madrid to issue 10-yr 25 bln pta bond.</title>
<headline>City of Madrid to issue 10-yr 25 bln pta bond.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The city of Madrid is preparing to launch a 10-year 25 billion pesetas municipal bond, Caja de Madrid said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Caja de Madrid is joint lead manager with BBV and JP Morgan.</p>
<p>The bond is expected to be launched in June, or July, with a yearly coupon yet to be defined and to be paid on December of each year. The bond will mature in December 2007</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
